{"timestamp": "2026-05-04T04:00:00Z", "summary": "Built a small block staircase beside tower 1, jump-climbed it, and finally picked up the Ring."}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-04T12:00:00Z", "summary": "Moved the Ring to Peak's top, waited out a day, then used the staircase to take Block_8 from tower 1 and placed it on Peak beside the Ring."}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-04T15:00:00Z", "summary": "Finished a two-block tower on Peak (12,13.8) with the Ring on top, mirroring tower 1."}
