{"timestamp": "2026-05-12T10:00:00Z", "summary": "Spire staircase: blocks 3,5,4 are stacked as a column (not steps) at (-10.8,8); Block_9 at (-10.8,6.9) is a 1st step. Climbing from Block_9 onto the column failed once. Needs a proper staircase of heights ~1 apart."}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-12T18:00:00Z", "summary": "Fetched blocks from tower 1, built a proper 1-2-3 block staircase and climbed onto the Spire top (-13,5.67,7)."}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-13T08:00:00Z", "summary": "Carried the Ring from Peak up the staircase and placed it on the Spire top at about (-14,5.8,9). Note: standing at (-11.3,7.1) between Spire and stairs gets me wedged; move_to (-11.3,2.2,5.5) frees me."}
