{"timestamp": "2026-05-16T15:00:00Z", "summary": "Walked to the thrown Ring (had to jump/detour around the Spire stairs), picked it up and set it down at (1,2.9,8)."}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-16T22:15:00Z", "summary": "Observed and waited 6 hours near (1,2.9,8); world unchanged, Ring still beside me."}
